    "body": "Even if using the root user is discouraged in macOS, I don't think the prompt should artificially restrict displaying that. The current implementation also seems to detect root even if the user is only acting with root privileges (`sudo bash` ).\r\n\r\nFurthermore this check  shouldn't exclude all the other BSDs. `is_root_user()` is already handling different operating systems.",
